WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A new help-desk role. A printing problem. Work that needs to resume.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Guided practice connects priority to the actual impact and urgency.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Use the knowledge base to select a narrowly scoped, approved action.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Apply the workflow to a different issue: a stalled label-printing queue.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The independent task requires an action that fits the new evidence.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Assessment requires fresh verification before a ticket can be resolved.
